    "runtime": "Vita newlib4.1.0 ABI; retain its headers/libc/libm/libgcc and matching Sce SDK imports from a compatible coreSDK. These are not Linux ARM,macOS orWindows libraries. Host OS may differ because target archives are ARM ELF, while the cross compiler/packaging tools must be native to the host.",
